Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.81,0:00:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,WWW!?!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.61,0:01:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for the big\Nfive. I should never have
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.65,0:01:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,hired those corporate\Nclowns excellent dueling
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.01,0:01:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How could they be\Nout-dueled by these two in a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.27,0:01:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,virtual world where i\Nmake all the rules if you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,want something done\Nright you have to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.15,0:01:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,yourself so perhaps it's\Ntime for me to step in i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.95,0:01:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,make sure they never\Nleave this place on behalf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.45,0:01:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,of myself and the big\Nfive i want to offer you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,our most sincere apologies\Nnoah johnson please
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.45,0:01:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,let me explain there's\Nnothing to explain you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.57,0:01:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,five have failed me for\Nthe last time now you're
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,all fired just hear me\Nout sir your slick lawyer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,talk won't get you out\Nof this one johnson so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.07,0:01:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,don't even try it so far\Nyour partners gansley
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.45,0:01:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and crump each suffered\Nan embarrassing defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,so why should i believe\Nthe rest of you won't fail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.63,0:01:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.33,0:01:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I must dispose of you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.99,0:01:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Noah, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.47,0:02:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We've analyzed our attack patterns,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.29,0:02:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and we've come up with a solid dueling
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.99,0:02:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,strategy that is guaranteed\Nto bring us success,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand my position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.05,0:02:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Big Five are desperate\Nto defeat these brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way we can take over their\Nbodies and leave the cyber world behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let them win. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a chance\Nto redeem yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.99,0:02:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.77,0:02:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be sorry. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.07,0:02:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if they fail me again,\Nhe will be the sorry one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Their failures are a reflection of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't allow Yugi and his friends\Nto make me look like a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find a way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for you, Seto, your\Npower will soon be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.77,0:02:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Craft 3, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.51,0:02:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Still can't get through?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal? Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.51,0:02:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,this place was designed to isolate us from\Noutside contact, but that won't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:02:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you old dudes, show yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your big business backsides.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.75,0:03:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of waiting for you suit-wearing,\Ndeal-making, pencil-neck geeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.03,0:03:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeep walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.11,0:03:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, real Jeep walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.97,0:03:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just knock. Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Jackpot, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I found the blimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.03,0:03:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we come, real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.33,0:03:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet the gang's already inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.63,0:03:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a ghost town. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.97,0:03:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The door to Mai's room is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That Marek freak better be\Nkeeping his distance from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.87,0:04:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Mai dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.81,0:04:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your trip to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.76,0:04:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you did to her now, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.43,0:04:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get your mind back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.37,0:04:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise, you'll be\Ndueling again in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My, you're back! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.53,0:04:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.11,0:04:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you're even less intelligent\Nthan you look, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.33,0:04:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's real here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.95,0:04:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.69,0:04:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known it was one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.23,0:04:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Johnson's the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Attorney at law and former chief legal\Nadvisor for the Kaiba Corporation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.49,0:04:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,at your service, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If you would just take\Nmy card, it's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.01,0:04:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it, sleazeball! Joseph,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.21,0:05:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,your presence is requested\Nat the trial of the century,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's in your best\Ninterest to listen to me. Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say the trial of the century?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.61,0:05:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's getting sued?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that I'm taking you to\Ncourt so I can claim your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,See, defeating you is my only means of\Nescape from this virtual holding cell,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.55,0:05:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've never lost a\Ncase in my life. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a first time for everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's no way you're escaping\Nto the real world in my body, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll change your mind before too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.37,0:05:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, controlling what\Npeople think is what I do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,allow me to state the reasons why I deserve\Nthe right to take control of your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.11,0:05:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I have had it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.51,0:05:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All your talk is making me dizzy, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.65,0:05:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm doing my job, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:06:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I say talk is cheap, so put\Nyour money where your mouth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.45,0:06:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, why don't you take the\Nstand so we can begin this trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.59,0:06:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough with the legal mumbo-jumbo, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,When you dragged us here, you\Nsaid we were gonna be dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.11,0:06:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's all this stuff about\Ntrials and taking the stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.23,0:06:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.37,0:06:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, the game of Duel\NMonsters is like a trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.09,0:06:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why's the room spinning, Johnson?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you to our\Ndueling site, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.85,0:06:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my friend, justice can be served.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.19,0:06:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel Monsters is like a trial,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,so we're better to duel\Nthan in a courtroom and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,when you lose you'll be\Nsentenced to spend eternity
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,here i won't lose johnson\Ni think you'll change your
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.05,0:06:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,tune once you've had the\Nopportunity to meet my deck
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,master so please be seated\Nthe honorable judge man
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.57,0:06:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,presiding yeah it is an\Nimprovement but it's not
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna help you win this\Nduel order one more outburst
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,like that and i'm holding\Nyou in contempt of court.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.39,0:07:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear, Joseph?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.19,0:07:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's guilty of being\Na real pain in the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The accused will now choose his deck from
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the card database so we\Ncan begin this duel. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply raise your right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.03,0:07:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This case is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've researched your duels extensively and\NI know exactly what cards you'll choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Objection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we begin,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.37,0:07:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to choose a monster from your\Ndeck to serve as your deck master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.01,0:07:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This shouldn't be too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Folks, we have a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.27,0:07:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So, meet my deck master, Flame Swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.51,0:07:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as this guy's standing next to\Nme judge there's no way i can possibly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.15,0:08:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,lose this you have my word as your deck\Nmaster that i will serve you well and guide
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.85,0:08:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you through this duel awesome he talks i\Nassure you we shall defeat our opponent
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.35,0:08:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,as you know i will be acting as my own
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,deck master so this\Ncourt is now in session
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're in my courtroom, I'll\Nbegin this duel. Watch and learn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.55,0:08:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,i call hysteric angel to the stand\Nshe'll make sure you get the maximum
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,sentence that is the most annoying\Nmonster i've ever seen she looks just
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,like you do johnson silence it's time to\Ncall your first witness Yes, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.47,0:08:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Gear Freed the Iron Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you play that card, I can increase\Nits attack points by decreasing mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I summon Gear Freed the Iron Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:09:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my Deck Master's special\Nability, he gets a power boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Gear Freed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.45,0:09:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his Hysteric Angel! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With Metal Forearm Thrust!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He shoots, he scores!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.49,0:09:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing but nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.71,0:09:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Prosecute that, Judge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He used his Deckmaster's\Nspecial ability right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, but this trial has just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place this monster face down\Nin defense mode and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My Deckmaster rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can keep taking attack points from\Nhim and adding them to my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you say we\Ntry this again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.71,0:09:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.99,0:09:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon little Wind God in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time, Judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll move 300 attack points from\Nmy Deck Master to my Wind God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:10:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll use it to\Nattack your face-down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you've\Ndestroyed my skill angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.87,0:10:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me draw one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need it, because\Nyou're out of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means I can do this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.19,0:10:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Gear-free, attack his\Nhonor's life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.03,0:10:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, having fun, Joseph?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.81,0:10:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm having a terrible time\Nkicking you around the courtroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.35,0:10:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm having fun, and this\Nparty is just beginning, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.69,0:10:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad you won't have\Nanything to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.23,0:10:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't realize I've let him get ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.65,0:10:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,for it's not the beginning\Nof the trial that counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.85,0:10:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the final verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.95,0:10:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for, Johnson?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.77,0:10:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I just like to watch the defendant squirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.41,0:10:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait until he feels the\Nwrath of my next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I call Mystical Elf to\Nthe stand in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.31,0:11:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll place one\Nmore card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.45,0:11:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy this while you can,\Nfor when the trial is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be charged with a lifetime\Nsentence in this virtual prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.79,0:11:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd give anything for a\Nhot chocolate. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.17,0:11:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take my coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a total lifesaver, Yugi. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, no sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're worried about\Neveryone else, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm especially worried\Nabout Tristan and Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.23,0:11:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just beginners,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and if they lose a duel to the\NBig Five, they're trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I can beat one of those\Ncreeps in a duel, then so can they.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.55,0:11:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Gesundheit, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.91,0:11:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for\Nswimming in the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.97,0:11:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Zip it, Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:11:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for\Nswimming in the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope they all\Nfound each other and they're
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.77,0:12:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,pulling together to find\Na way out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.31,0:12:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Great,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you got Serenity sick.\NWay to go, germ boy. Oh yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.59,0:12:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke, as if You better stay away or\Nyou might catch my evil germs too Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you're a riot Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.45,0:12:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,those guys always have\Neach other's back I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,sure they're gonna be just\Nfine Of course they are
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.61,0:12:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,After today,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.83,0:12:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I never want to see a virtual tree\Nagain It figures That punk Noah must be
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,keeping us trapped here because he's too\Nterrified to confront me face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A very interesting theory, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.83,0:12:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course, you're wrong again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Another door. Should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.73,0:12:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see where that kid's leading us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.51,0:12:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.89,0:12:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back at home at Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.87,0:13:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a virtual simulation of my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.61,0:13:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No one disturbs me here. I know that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm sick of waiting to talk to you\Nand I have something important to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, another virtual scene from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.59,0:13:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.89,0:13:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the day I was finally able to work\Nup the courage to confront our stepfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here to talk about\Nyour invention, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, kid, I've already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how long it took me\Nto design that virtual video game software?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.85,0:13:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You just can't admit that I\Ninvented something you never could.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.57,0:13:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.57,0:13:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This little game of\Nyours is of no use to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My software could make this\Ncompany billions of dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.01,0:13:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, you little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't make children's toys here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,KivaCorp is my company, and\Nwe make vehicles for combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.68,0:13:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.59,0:13:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to take\Nover this company someday,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have to forget about your games.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.99,0:14:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I adopted you so you can\Nlearn my family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.23,0:14:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The business of fighting\Nbattles, defeating your enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.67,0:14:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and rising to ultimate\Npower. No way! You're insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards, take my stepson away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, take your hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.99,0:14:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't treat me like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be sorry, you old fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did my stepfather shoot\Ndown my virtual gaming program,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but to make things worse, he stole my\Ninvention and passed it off as his own!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.55,0:14:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, we're back in Noah's virtual forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't call it Noah's forest, Mokuba,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,because whoever helped Noah\Ncreate this place is using the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,same virtual technology that\Nour stepfather stole from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.21,0:14:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it's been enhanced, the basic\Nprogram is the same as mine. That's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.33,0:14:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have a feeling it's no coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.15,0:14:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to remember that\Neverything we see here is an
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:15:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,illusion because all of these\Nmemories are messing with my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, I don't know who you\Nare, kid, but I'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can hear everything I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.73,0:15:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and no matter what you're after and\Nwho's helping you, you'll never succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you're so powerful, why don't you\Ncome down here and face me, you coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.41,0:15:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All in good time, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All in good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.83,0:15:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Call your next witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.05,0:15:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.25,0:15:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.77,0:15:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so what's my plan here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.07,0:15:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got one monster on the\Nfield and one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.43,0:15:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So first things first, I\Ngotta blow away his monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.43,0:15:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Rocket Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.85,0:15:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive arsenal\NI got here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Johnson, you got any last requests?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm about to throw the book and a\Nbig iron claw right at your last monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.61,0:16:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Gear Freed, time to\Ncrush his mystical elf. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Deckmaster Ability. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, that's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like his Deckmaster\Nhas special powers, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet another amateur move on his part.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's time to show this kid\Nwhat the Judge Man can really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.55,0:16:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear the courtroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, clear the courtroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.91,0:16:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.43,0:16:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving up 1,000 life points\Nto activate my special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.95,0:16:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you must clear the field of all your\Nmonsters so you're back where you started.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.59,0:16:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.85,0:16:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my lawyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not through. Next,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.97,0:16:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll lose 500 life\Npoints for each monster
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.41,0:16:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,you were forced to remove from the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.85,0:16:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I had three monsters,\Nso that means I lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,1,500 life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:16:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct, Joseph. Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, minor problem, but\NI've got this under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.53,0:17:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.09,0:17:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A bottomless trap hole card!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But this baby will let\Nme remove any monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,from the field with 1,500\Nattack points or more. Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.27,0:17:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not the only one that\Ncan clear the courtroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your days in this courthouse\Nare numbered, Jansen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I send that\Nmystical elf of yours packing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.07,0:17:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going straight for your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And what evidence do you have\Nto pack that up, may I ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I have this card!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.93,0:17:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.31,0:17:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.49,0:17:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of a doorway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.17,0:17:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where it leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.03,0:17:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who let in the draft?\NCan it be? It's Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.77,0:17:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi! Taya! Where you been? Order!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.81,0:17:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.95,0:17:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This cork is still in session\Nin case you hadn't noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dueling one of the big five,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.13,0:18:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're just in time to see me\Nwipe the courtroom floor with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's my move, so sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.67,0:18:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky I don't have you\Ntwo ejected from this courtroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.19,0:18:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey has no monsters,\Nand it's this guy's turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.59,0:18:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Curtain of the Dark Ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I reveal my face-down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.23,0:18:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Polymerization.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.51,0:18:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Diffuse together my Mystical Elf\Nand my Curtain of the Dark Ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever monster he's\Ncreating will get sucked
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.39,0:18:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Right into my bottomless trap\Nhole. Meet Magician Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.61,0:18:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.07,0:18:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,it's only got 1300 attack points\NMy trap won't work on any monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,With less than 1500. Next, I'll\Nplay the card Sinister Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows my fusion monster to attack\Nin the same turn in which it was summoned
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.07,0:19:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Cannon Wizard attack his\Nlife points directly. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.87,0:19:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky move, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.77,0:19:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Sinister\NJustice is on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Johnson gets 800 extra\Nlife points every time he
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Attacks Joey's life points\Nwith his Cannon Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.07,0:19:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The spiky-headed bipsqueak is right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,His life points are going up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.85,0:19:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I placed this card face\Ndown to seal your doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.93,0:19:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for that trap\Ncard, I would've won this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.97,0:19:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, every time he attacks me,\Nhe gets stronger and stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.41,0:19:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You planned this all along,\Ndidn't you, Johnson? Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.25,0:19:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have far worse in\Nstore for you, Joseph!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.89,0:20:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, yo, yo, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
